Go to the Google Cloud Console,
and your Home page opens up.

00:10:35.490 --> 00:10:39.060
Select Network Services and
Load Balancing, or simply type

00:10:39.060 --> 00:10:41.580
"load balancing" in your
search and select this.

00:10:41.580 --> 00:10:45.690
You can see your existing load
balancers here and your backend

